# 💳 Microsoft 365 Licensing

Licensing determines which Microsoft 365 services and features a user can access.

For support purposes, an administrator may need to investigate:

> "The user cannot access Teams."

Possible causes could include:

* Account issue
* License issue
* Service issue
* Permission issue
* Configuration issue

Therefore:

```text
User problem
 ↓
Check account
 ↓
Check license/service
 ↓
Check permissions
 ↓
Check service health
```

